cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.6.0
date-released: 2026-08-16
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact identity between the native real-camera
  and Genuine zero, the unique optimal seeded TFVD radial-defect energy budget,
  the exact empirical C2--C7 camera geometry including the C4/C6 antipodal
  channels, collective cutoff-tail identities and fixed-time critical upper
  bounds, an explicit local remainder and candidate leading-tail monomial with
  exact logarithmic phase, a strictly positive algebraic projection floor under
  a nonzero-derivative hypothesis, and conditional passage of supplied uniform
  transverse coercivity to a supplied limiting energy.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - Genuine continuation
  - carry geometry
  - TFVD
  - Green identity
  - transverse coercivity
  - Hessian
  - primitive camera operator
  - six-camera cutoff operator
  - cutoff-tail leading model
  - phase projection
  - uniform atlas
  - critical half-abscissa
  - reproducible proof audit
